{"id":"memorial_104904","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial104900","label":"Memoirs · *Attention* How to Use the Furnace"},"label":"04. Things We Need to Find","stage":null,"prev":"memorial_104903","next":null,"speakers":{},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_104904_1","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_49_04_description","text":"Uh... while you're out looking for materials, if you happen to spot... male humans, make sure to tell me, okay? Heh heh... and if possible, capture them alive."},{"id":"memorial_104904_2","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_49_04_description","text":"Um... so..."},{"id":"memorial_104904_3","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_49_04_description","text":"We're making the Queen—a living being, right?"},{"id":"memorial_104904_4","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_49_04_description","text":"And to create new life... we need a man's essence. That'll be the seed of life that births the Queen!"},{"id":"memorial_104904_5","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_49_04_description","text":"You get what I mean, right?"},{"id":"memorial_104904_6","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_49_04_description","text":"If not, just snatch up any man you see."},{"id":"memorial_104904_7","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_49_04_description","text":"After that..."},{"id":"memorial_104904_8","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_49_04_description","text":"Hmm..."},{"id":"memorial_104904_9","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_49_04_description","text":"Anyway, just start by finding them first. We'll figure out the rest later."}]}